---
import Twemoji from '@/components/ui/Twemoji.astro';
---

<div class="hidden" id="bios">
  <ul>
    <li>I'm aliased as <b class="font-medium">Dawn</b> at work.</li>
    <li>I live in <b class="font-medium">Hanoi, Vietnam</b>.</li>
    <li>I was born in <b class="font-medium">Hanoi</b>.</li>
    <li>My first programming language was <b class="font-medium">JavaScript</b>.</li>
    <li>I’m passionate about <b class="font-medium">web development</b>.</li>
    <li>I’m currently growing as a <b class="font-medium">Software Engineer</b>.</li>
    <li>
      I work mostly with <b class="font-medium">Java</b> and <b class="font-medium">Typescript</b>{' '}
      technologies.
    </li>
    <li>
      I'm a tech enthusiast who loves
      <span class="ml-1">
        <Twemoji emoji="desktop-computer" />, <Twemoji emoji="keyboard" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      I enjoy listening to <Twemoji emoji="musical-keyboard" /> and <b class="font-medium">J-pop</b>{' '}
      music.
    </li>
    <li>
